    "updated_at": "2026-11-23T23:25:54Z",
    "body": "6. **Prompt history.** Up and Down in the prompt field step through the prompts sent earlier in this session, like a shell, so that one can be edited and sent again. Down past the newest returns to the draft that was being typed. Keep it per session. Optionally keep it across sessions as well, without any reply text.\n(Reporter, 2026-11-23, after the assistant added a 4 mm 2FL end mill and Contour1, and warned about the contour top below the stock top: \"Ok. I'm impressed.\")\n",
