    "updated_at": "2026-11-23T23:44:00Z",
    "body": "9. **The chat outlives the project.** After New project, the AI Chat panel still shows the old project's conversation, and that conversation is sent with the next prompt. The model then reasons about operations, tools and IDs that are no longer there. The old turns' \"Undo Turn\" buttons also stay visible, but the project's undo history is gone. Wanted:\n   - a **Clear chat** button;\n   - New and Open start a fresh conversation, or ask \"Keep the chat for the new project?\";\n   - \"Undo Turn\" is disabled, with the reason, on turns that belong to a different or reset document. Check what it does today: it must never undo commands in the new project.\n   (Reporter, 2026-11-23.)\n",
